Theater Arts#,#Theater Arts#,#HASS Concentration in Theater Arts#,#Concentration in Theater Arts

A concentration in Theater Arts requires 36 credits (typically three 12-credit courses). Up to nine units of theater practicum may count toward the concentration.

intro_theater, "Introductory Theater Courses" := 21T.100/21T.101, 21T.102/21T.103, 21T.104/21T.110, 21T.111/21T.120, 21T.121/21T.122, 21T.130/21T.131, 21T.141/21T.150

performance, "Performance Courses" := 21T.201/21T.202, 21T.203/21T.204, 21T.210/21T.231, 21T.240/21T.301, 21T.331/21T.340

design, "Design Courses" := 21T.220/21T.221, 21T.222/21T.223, 21T.224/21T.230, 21T.320/21T.321

drama_studies, "Drama and Playwriting" := 21T.241/21T.242, 21T.243/21T.244, 21T.245/21T.246, 21T.247/21T.248, 21T.250/21T.251, 21T.345/21T.350, 21T.355

advanced_topics, "Advanced Theater Topics" := 21T.420/21T.421, 21T.422/21T.423, 21T.424/21T.425

all_theater, "All Theater Arts Courses" := intro_theater / performance / design / drama_studies / advanced_topics

practicum, "Theater Practicum" := 21T.400/21T.403, 21T.406/21T.409
%% Up to 9 units of practicum may be included

theater_requirement, "Three Theater Arts Subjects (36 credits)" := (all_theater){>=3}
%% Typically three 12-unit courses

total, "Total Requirements" := theater_requirement

